Scope

This MIT license covers the source code of this repository (*.py files,
configuration and tests).

The study documents (everything in docs/, the preprint in paper/ with its
text, figures and references, piloto/LEIAME.md and the original material in
initial_docs/ other than code and data) are licensed separately under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0); see LICENSE-docs
or https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data

Neither license applies to third-party data.
Data files under piloto/dados/ (and any microdata downloaded by the scripts)
come from third parties and remain under their original terms:

- CDC BRFSS (data.cdc.gov, dataset hn4x-zwk7): U.S. federal government work,
  public domain.
- AHRQ MEPS (meps.ahrq.gov): U.S. federal government work, public domain,
  subject to the MEPS data use agreement.
- U.S. Census Bureau (SCPRC-EST2024-18+POP): public domain.
- The RX Index (therxindex.com) and PurpleLab via GLP-1 Newsroom: values
  transcribed from public web pages; rights belong to their publishers.
- state-abbrevs.csv: github.com/jakevdp/data-USstates.
